# Advisor XML

Files in `audit/advisor/` are handoffs for later agents. Prose inside them is English.

- Read `<meta>`, `<decision>`, and `<next-steps>` before acting.
- Run `<step>` items in `id` order and honor `<depends-on>`.
- Do not perform `owner="developer"` steps. If one is `pending`, stop and send the developer to `<pair><markdown>`.
- For `owner="delegated-agent"`, invoke `<delegate-to>` instead of doing the work.
- Do not rewrite the plan unless the user called `/advisor --update` on this file.
- The filename is `YYYY-MM-DD-ADVISOR-<title>.xml`, for example `2026-11-05-ADVISOR-example.xml`.
- Keep `<pair><markdown>` pointed at `local/advisor/YYYY-MM-DD-ADVISOR-<title>.md` with the same date, `ADVISOR`, and title.

```xml
<step id="2" owner="agent" status="pending">
  <title>Add the health route</title>
  <depends-on>1</depends-on>
</step>
```

A `developer` step stays pending until the person finishes it.
